# This project has two services, each with its own real .env.example:
#   backend/.env.example   — FastAPI settings (DATABASE_URL, RUNPOD_API_KEY, etc.)
#   frontend/.env.example  — Vite settings (VITE_API_BASE_URL, VITE_USE_MOCKS)
#
# Copy whichever you need to backend/.env or frontend/.env.local and fill in
# only what you actually have. Never commit real secrets — see .gitignore.
